# - Publications of the Astronomical Society of the Pacific
# - How many comets were discovered by Jean-Louis Pons? - https://www.comethunter.de/pons.html
#
# Columns:
# - IAU designation
# - Date designation
# - Perihelion designation (COMET PERIHELION NUMBER)
# - Discovery designation (COMET PROVISIONAL NUMBER)
# - Date of discovery
# - Discoverer (a person)
